title: $:/language/wikilabs/scroll-memory/

Buttons/Top/Hint: Get to the top of the tiddler
Buttons/Toggle/Hint: Toggle between the last landmark and your open drafts
Buttons/Back/Hint: Back to the previous recorded position
Buttons/Forward/Hint: Forward to the next recorded position
Buttons/BackConsume/Hint: Scroll back to the last link you followed
NavigationLabel: Scroll memory navigation
Notifications/First: Scroll memory: first entry reached
Notifications/Last: Scroll memory: last entry reached
